        "date": "2026-11-18T12:02:42Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): hold the rotate drag to the move-drag standard of #1330\n\n- The rings use the cached centre of #1330 (no facet walk on a still\n  frame); the paint computes the rings once per frame (ring_in).\n- A focus loss or a pointer that leaves the window cancels a turn; a\n  later release queues nothing.\n- A ray within 3 degrees of the ring plane, or a hit within 6 px of the\n  pivot, holds the last angle; the summed angle must stay finite.\n- Tests: a_still_frame_walks_no_facets_and_a_turn_walks_them_again,\n  a_cursor_on_the_pivot_holds_the_turn,\n  focus_loss_mid_turn_cancels_and_a_later_release_sends_no_turn.\n\nRefs #2047\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
